# Generated analysis output. The Dockerfile is `COPY . .`, so anything not named
# here SHIPS — and *.log alone does not cover these. They are inert (nothing
# imports them) but they are stale numbers riding into production, and the
# .gitignore list had drifted ahead of this one. Keep the two in sync.
.eval-*.txt
.claude-top5-eval-spec.txt
.top4-*.txt
.top5-*.txt
.lookahead-sweep.json
causal_audit.csv
shadow_diff.csv
nnfx_audit_results.json
prop_guard_state.json

# Documentation. NOTE: do NOT add a blanket *.md rule — program.md, thesis.md,
# reviewer.md, role_reviewer.md and categories/*.md are prompt files that
# meta_review.py and auto_research.py read at runtime, and both are in
# fix_runner.py's import closure.
README.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
CONFIGURATION.md
FILE_STRUCTURE.md
BACKLOG.md
QUICKSTART.md
BRANCH_CHECKLIST.md
PROJECT_COMPLETION_SUMMARY.md
INTEGRATE_honesty.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
